<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This macro, simulates the special attack  "Toxic Wreath" from Street Fighter character AKI, You can access to this move with just one button. The controls:

W:: UP
A:: LEFT
D:: RIGHT
S:: DOWN

K:: HARD PUNCH</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 22 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyDown 4 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 22 1
Delay 12 ms
KeyUp 4 1
KeyDown 14 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 14 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Street Fighter 6</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>